tinacloud-completion-powershell(1) -- Generate powershell completion script
===========================================================================

## DESCRIPTION

Generate a powershell completion script.

Open your profile script, creating it if necessary:
	mkdir -Path (Split-Path -Parent $profile) -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue
	notepad $profile

Add this line and save the file:
	Invoke-Expression -Command $(tinacloud completion powershell | Out-String)

## SYNOPSIS

`tinacloud completion powershell`

## EXAMPLES

Enable completions for the current PowerShell session:

	PS> Invoke-Expression -Command $(tinacloud completion powershell | Out-String)

To persist them, add that command to your PowerShell profile.

